msgid "ARCHIVED TOPIC: out of date and no longer needed"
msgstr "已归档主题：内容已过时且不再需要"

#: ../../source/docs/common-web-apps.rst:9 18f2adf0cfe4427984c233945278bd53
#: 3602ed8ab77042918ac3de38e6dd64aa 93622d455f0c4160af837f152315d64f
#: c5aabb552c584e6baf45392aed55020d e7a0e70de5f34aed8214e04e3c1baa9a
msgid ""
"There are several web applications which can be used with Copter/Plane/Rover"
" to allowing sharing flight data, videos or even allowing web based control."
" Below is the list of known applications (in alphabetical order)."
msgstr ""
"有多个 Web 应用可与 Copter/Plane/Rover 配合使用，支持分享飞行数据、视频，甚至实现基于 Web "
"的控制。以下是已知应用列表（按字母顺序排列）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-web-apps.rst:15 2b8dc32433604d70bdf10c78b1935135
#: 52907d7ebfe440c38e7a0b747d2c7707 635ed27212d34d30847746658d51bc46
#: a4646961bd7b408584a5333fae1e27f7 fc8cbe5f87ac405e99c04d7570a812b0
msgid ""
"`dronetrack.org <http://www.dronetrack.org/>`__ - Real-Time tracking and "
"sharing of flight paths"
msgstr "`dronetrack.org <http://www.dronetrack.org/>`__ - 实时跟踪和分享飞行路径"

#: ../../source/docs/common-web-apps.rst:18 0d6d31a209d74e17a5c339c673bf9a98
#: 7ffdb190fae34c918622c06bf7322dfc 81083caa7ff548e29fad27c87bd82fe9
#: ddf5573b363a4b21b5d15eaa3985aea0 ea57cb6cf2c842058abcc3a6fdf65c49
msgid ""
"`EXmaps.com <https://www.exmaps.com/>`__ - online flight logbook made for "
"the ArduPilot system. Just drag and drop log files for post flight analysis "
"and cumulative flight time"
msgstr ""
"`EXmaps.com <https://www.exmaps.com/>`__ - 为 ArduPilot "
"系统设计的在线飞行日志。拖放日志文件即可进行飞行后分析和累计飞行时间统计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-web-apps.rst:22 80a648e4d15c49a0a623216023b9ce02
#: 8a52a2198fac4165b039e1c0535dc2b9 c54969d899c74242a8ed2dbce7a68f04
#: c8c851fd1e3942f9a2d0899965f1c554 ff44d8926bf249d39e9ccd8170b37e56
msgid ""
"`UAViators.org <http://uaviators.org/>`__ - video sharing site to aid "
"humanitarian organizations and disaster affected communities with greater "
"situation awareness."
msgstr ""
"`UAViators.org <http://uaviators.org/>`__ - 视频分享网站，旨在帮助人道主义组织和受灾社区获得更好的态势感知"

#: ../../source/docs/common-web-apps.rst:27 3bf4a323bbb2436bb9070dcee445956c
#: 3dc38f0199bb42b0b8c8d7ecd350978a ca9796eebfbd48cbac1dd7d1ade5050a
#: cbcdcd44b87a4c9db5e9856ac7632681 e406c4a0cc6a4e83a25ac85c6e7c0db5
msgid ""
"If you know other applications, or you are the owner of one of the above and"
" would like to correct the description; please leave your comments in the "
"Git Issue Tracker down on the footer. You also feel free to edit these pages"
" straightforward by clicking on \"Edit on Github\" on the top right of the "
"page."
msgstr ""
"如您知晓其他应用，或您是上述应用的所有者并希望修正描述，请在页面底部的 Git Issue Tracker 中留言。也欢迎直接点击页面右上角的「Edit"
" on Github」编辑本页面。"
